d 'RCSPLOT': module to produce restricted cubic spline plot with matched model and plot ranges, optional histogram overlay, shaded confidence bandwidth adjustable opacity, survey support, and outlier trimming
d
d      rcsplot fits a restricted cubic spline (RCS) model for a
d single exposure variable and plots the resulting dose-response
d curve        with a confidence band. By default, the modeled data
d and the plotted x-range are identical: both are defined by the
d trim	      percentile window (1st to 99th percentile of the
d exposure). This ensures the plot shows exactly the data on which
d the	     model was fit, with no gap between the modeled sample
d and the plotted region. 
d
d KW: graphics
d KW: cubic splines
d
d Requires: Stata version 16
d
d Distribution-Date: 20261004
d
d Author: Zumin Shi ,  Qatar University
d Support: email  zumin.shi@@qu.edu.qa
d
f rcsplot.ado
f rcsplot.sthlp
